// The restore slip (@8258): what the desktop's backup holds (restoreOptions,
// from 'ropt') - the applications' information, the packages, and the store to
// restore to - to pick from; Restore sends the choice ('ropt') and shows the
// progress slip.  Restoring replaces the Newton's information and restarts.

